        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtūngīlīja bo ng'hana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwa kūmalīja badūgū bane gūlī gīkī, yegelagi mulī Seeba; ū nene natīko ū kūnoga ū kwikala nishokeela kūng'wandīkīla mihayo h'ī yenīyo dūhū, nguno īkūmulang'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakangūkagi a banhū a bahūnga, a ba nhūngwa gītī ja mva, abo basendamīlile mhayo gwa kūsaalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a bise h'abo tūsaalilwe, a bise abo tūkalamyaga mu kūtongeelwa na Moyo wa ng'wa Mulungu, na tūkayegelaga mulī Kilisito Yesu; abo tūtasendamīlile mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkī ūlū mhayo gwa kūsendamīla mīlī dūhū, nūūlū ū nene nagūdūgije; ūlū alīho munhū asendamīlile mihayo ya mīlī, ū nene nalī kū būtongi ū mu yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakasaalwa nataalī ng'weleele wa shikū inaane, nalī w'ihanga lya Bayudaya gete, wa lūganda lo ng'wa Benjamini. Ng'hebulania wa Bahebulania, ū mu kashimīzīle ka mu shilagīlo naalī Mfalisayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būjangīīzu naalī nuhya wa kanisa, hama ū mu būtūngīlīja ūbo būfumile mu shilagīlo, naalī natī na shilingo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mihayo īyo yaninhaga solobo, ī haha nakwībalaga kūbiza ya būjimīīja kūlwa ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nīyo na kūtinda ho a henaho, nguno pyī ī mihayo nakwībalaga kūbiza ya dalali kūlwa wiza būtaale wa kūmana Kilisito Yesu Seeba wane, ūyo kūlwa nguno yakwe naajimīīja pyī ī shikolo. Nīyo nakūshibalaga kūbiza gītī maashi, gīkī nampandīke ū Kilisito, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na nabonekane nalī mulī we, ītī kūlwa būtūngīlīja bone bo mu shilagīlo; alīyo kūlwa kūnzunya Kilisito, kūlwa būtūngīlīja bo ng'wa Mulungu ūbo būfumile mu kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natogilwe naamane wei ng'wenekīlī, pyī nū būdūla bo kūjūūka kwakwe, nū būsangī wa kūluhiwa hamò nang'hwe. Nū nene nabize gīt'ūmo alī ū wei ū mu kūcha kwakwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī ūlū yūdūlīkana, nane nalawanukūle ū būjūūko bo bafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnanamīīla ya kū būtongi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ītī kūhaya gīkī ū nene naamalile kūheeba, nūūlū gīkī naashikile a ha ngelelo ya būshikanu, alīyo nataalī nakūzegejaga, nane nagūdime ūyo Kilisito Yesu anidimile kūlwa nguno yago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badūgū bane, ū nene ng'wenekīlī natibalaga gīkī namala kūdima, alīyo gūlīho gūmò dūhū ūyo nakūgwītaga, kwība ī ya kū numa, na kūnanamīīla ya kū būtongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būlīngīsīji bone būlī gīkī nashipandīke ī shakwinhwa sha kwigūlya, gīt'ūmo kalī kitanīle ka ng'wa Mulungu mulī Kilisito Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū pye abo tūlī bashikanu tūbizagi nago ū mhayo gwenūyū; hama nūūlū mukabiza mulī n'iganiko līngī, ū Mulungu akūmukundūlīla nī lyenīlo nalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī haha tūshimīzīlagi ū mu mhayo ūyo twamalile kūgūpandīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we badūgū, bizagi balondeeji bane; ng'ūbitegeleja abo bakūshimīzaga gīt'ūmo būlī būlolelo ūbo tūkamulekela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nakūmuwīlaga gwa gwa gwa; hangī nī haha nalīmuwīla, nīyo mu kūlīla, gīkī balīho bangī ū mu shimīzīle yabo balī banishi ba nsalaba go ng'wa Kilisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū benabo ī ng'halīlo yabo īlī kūyagala, ī nda jabo hū mulungu wabo, ī mihayo īyo yigelile kūbadimya minala h'īyo bakīkumīlījaga, a maganiko gabo galolile kū shikolo sha mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bise ū būjigajiga wise būlī ng'wigūlū, hama nīyo ū kūfuma ko ū kwenūko, tūnindīīlile mpīja Seeba Yesu Kilisito; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PHP 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo akūgūgalūcha ū mīlī gwise ūyo gūtī n'ikūjo gūbize gīt'ūmo gūlī gwakwe ū gw'ikūjo, kūlenganīla na būdūla bokwe ūbo akatūmamīlaga kūshitūūla ha sīlīlī yakwe pyī ī shikolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PHP.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PHP.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
